<title>USA: BAB Holdings testing Sam's Club sites.</title>
<headline>BAB Holdings testing Sam's Club sites.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>BAB Holdings Inc, which operates Big Apple Bagels stores, said Monday it will begin delivering bagels daily to five Sam's Warehouse Clubs stores in the Northern Illinois-area.</p>
<p>Sam's Warehouse Clubs is a unit of Wal-Mart Stores Inc.</p>
<p>The test is scheduled to begin within the next two weeks.</p>
<p>BAB Holdings also operates Brewster's Coffee Co stores and My Favorite Muffin stores.</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
